From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 13:12:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_ui: composer glow band, border breath, and agent panel
 micro-polish

Re-derived patch 0242 against v1.10.3. Upstream refactored thread_view.rs
(queue-row editor_focused branching, 3-arg toggle_thinking_block_expansion,
composer .p_2 -> .py_2), so the glow band / border-breath / queue animate-in /
eased disclosure rotations were re-anchored onto the new render code rather
than applied textually. disclosure.rs + conversation_view.rs hunks applied
cleanly. Restores the accent gradient that vanished when 0242 was dropped
during the replay.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
